=== Commands

System commands and the extension ecosystem are already rich enough to cover most daily needs. A command is simply one key press that completes a task for you -- often one that would otherwise take several steps.

*My crafted command:*

~~~
{}{raw}
<div class="command-item">
<p><span class="command-label"><span class="command-key">⌘</span>Capture webpage as .md for lzengan</span> &ndash; saves the active browser page as a Markdown file with images stored locally, then copies the file to the clipboard. This one is actually a full Raycast extension I wrote, not a script command.</p>
</div>
~~~

. *Why I craft it:* I often send web pages to AI agents so they can read the content and discuss it with me, but anti-scraping measures often block them from seeing the page (WeChat articles especially).
. *What it does:* one key turns the page open in my browser into a Markdown file with images stored locally, and copies it to the clipboard -- ready to hand straight to an agent, with no more printing the page to a PDF and sending it over.
. *The code:* open-sourced at [https://github.com/Johnnyzlee/raycast-webpage2md Johnnyzlee/raycast-webpage2md]. If you need the same, clone the repo, run +npm install+ and +npm run dev+, and Raycast will import it.

~~~
{}{raw}
<div class="section-anchor" id="scripts" aria-hidden="true"></div>
~~~

=== Scripts

*How to create:* type +Create Script Command+ in Raycast, pick a language template, and save the file into any folder you have added under Settings -> Script Commands -> Add Script Directory. Every script in that folder becomes a searchable command, and metadata edits are picked up automatically.

*What is a Script Command:* a plain-text script with a metadata header at the top (+title+, +icon+, +mode+, ...). Raycast indexes it as a first-class command: run it from root search, bind it to a hotkey, or pin it to the menu bar. On macOS, built-in support covers:

- shell (bash, zsh)
- Python
- Node.js
- Ruby
- PHP
- Swift
- AppleScript (+.applescript+, +.scpt+)

plus any other interpreter via the shebang line. The +@raycast.mode+ metadata picks how the output is shown:

- +fullOutput+ -- output opens in a full window with scrollback; ANSI colors supported
- +compact+ -- output shown in a compact window, trimmed to the essentials
- +inline+ -- output rendered directly in the command's row in root search, auto-refreshed with +@raycast.refreshTime+
- +silent+ -- no output at all; the script just runs and a toast reports success or failure

Two more useful flags: +@raycast.needsConfirmation true+ shows a confirmation dialog before running, handy for destructive scripts; +@raycast.argument1+ and up to three arguments prompt for values in the search bar before the script runs, passed to it as +$1+, +$2+, or +$3+ (in bash).

*My crafted scripts:* Both scripts below read their API keys from macOS Keychain at run time, so set them up first: create a DeepSeek API key at +https:\/\/platform.deepseek.com\/api_keys+ and an Exa service key from your Exa admin dashboard, then store each in Keychain with the account set to your macOS username and the service name exactly +DeepSeek API Key+ or +Exa Service API Key+.

~~~
{}{raw}
<div class="command-item">
<p><span class="command-label"><span class="command-key">⌘</span>DeepSeek balance for lzengan</span> &ndash; shows the current DeepSeek account balance in CNY as an inline Raycast row, refreshed every 30 minutes. The API key is pulled from macOS Keychain at run time, so no key ever lives in the script.</p>
<div class="copy-block">
<details>
<summary><span class="copy-block-marker">▸</span><span class="copy-block-title">Script (bash)</span><button type="button" class="copy-btn" data-copy="copy-deepseek-balance" aria-label="Copy to clipboard"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="14" height="14" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 6.75C0 5.784.784 5 1.75 5h1.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-1.5a.25.25 0 0 0-.25.25v7.5c0 .138.112.25.25.25h7.5a.25.25 0 0 0 .25-.25v-1.5a.75.75 0 0 1 1.5 0v1.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 9.25 16h-7.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 0 14.25Z"></path><path d="M5 1.75C5 .784 5.784 0 6.75 0h7.5C15.216 0 16 .784 16 1.75v7.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 14.25 11h-7.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 5 9.25Zm1.75-.25a.25.25 0 0 0-.25.25v7.5c0 .138.112.25.25.25h7.5a.25.25 0 0 0 .25-.25v-7.5a.25.25 0 0 0-.25-.25Z"></path></svg></button></summary>
<pre id="copy-deepseek-balance">#!/bin/bash

# Required parameters:
# @raycast.schemaVersion 1
# @raycast.title DeepSeek balance for lzengan
# @raycast.mode inline
# @raycast.refreshTime 30m

# Optional parameters:
# @raycast.icon 💰
# @raycast.packageName DeepSeek
# @raycast.description 查询 DeepSeek 人民币账户总余额

account_name="$(/usr/bin/id -un)"

api_key="$(
  /usr/bin/security find-generic-password \
    -a "$account_name" \
    -s "DeepSeek API Key" \
    -w 2>/dev/null
)"

if [ -z "$api_key" ]; then
  echo "未找到 DeepSeek API Key"
  exit 1
fi

if ! result="$(
  /usr/bin/curl \
    -sS \
    --connect-timeout 5 \
    --max-time 15 \
    -w $'\n%{http_code}' \
    -H "Accept: application/json" \
    -H "Authorization: Bearer $api_key" \
    "https://api.deepseek.com/user/balance"
)"; then
  echo "查询失败：无法连接 DeepSeek"
  exit 1
fi

http_status="${result##*$'\n'}"
body="${result%$'\n'*}"

extract_json() {
  printf '%s' "$body" |
    /usr/bin/plutil -extract "$1" raw -o - -- - 2>/dev/null
}

if [ "$http_status" != "200" ]; then
  error_message="$(extract_json "error.message")"

  if [ -z "$error_message" ]; then
    error_message="HTTP $http_status"
  fi

  echo "查询失败：$error_message"
  exit 1
fi

balance_count="$(extract_json "balance_infos")"
is_available="$(extract_json "is_available")"
cny_balance=""

if ! [[ "$balance_count" =~ ^[0-9]+$ ]]; then
  echo "查询失败：返回数据格式异常"
  exit 1
fi

for ((i = 0; i < balance_count; i++)); do
  currency="$(extract_json "balance_infos.$i.currency")"

  if [ "$currency" = "CNY" ]; then
    cny_balance="$(extract_json "balance_infos.$i.total_balance")"
    break
  fi
done

if [ -z "$cny_balance" ]; then
  echo "查询失败：没有找到人民币余额"
  exit 1
fi

if [ "$is_available" = "true" ]; then
  echo "DeepSeek 余额：¥$cny_balance"
else
  echo "⚠️ DeepSeek 余额不足：¥$cny_balance"
fi</pre>
</details>
</div>
</div>
