<p><span class="command-label"><span class="command-key">⌘⇧B</span>Chat Branching</span> &ndash; branches any AI conversation &ndash; Quick AI, AI Chat, or AI Command &ndash; so you can explore another angle; the original chat is preserved, and you can compare both threads side by side.</p>
</div>
